  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1: Weather remains quiet through Friday, rain\nchances return this weekend, persisting into next week.\n\nThrough Friday, conditions should be dry, dominated by an upper\nridge of high pressure. Temperatures should remain below normal\nfor the end of July, along with lower humidity.\n \nA slow-moving low pressure system approaches from the west by\nSaturday, increasing rain chances for the weekend and into early\nnext week...Daily potential for afternoon/evening storms as\nsoutherly flow increases ahead of the system. High temperatures\nstill expected to remain on the cooler side in the upper 70s to\nlow 80s as a result of clouds and rain.",
